<aside class="site-sidebar" aria-label="博客功能分区">
  <section class="profile-card">
    <div class="profile-index"><span>01</span><span>MYSELF</span></div>
    <div class="profile-person">
      <img src="<%- url_for(theme.profile.avatar) %>" alt="Halfold 的头像">
      <div><strong><%= theme.profile.name %></strong><span><%= theme.profile.role %></span></div>
    </div>
    <p><%= theme.profile.intro %></p>
  </section>

  <section class="side-note">
    <span class="eyebrow">little reminder</span>
    <p>把正在发生的事，慢慢写成以后可以回看的地方。</p>
  </section>
</aside>
